OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying dry
OL,6,Fwith patchy cloud increasing by dawn
OL,7,Ffrom the south and west. Feeling cold,
OL,8,Fwith a frost and some freezing fog
OL,9,Fpatches likely by dawn where skies
OL,10,Fstay clearer.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA mostly dry but frosty start
OL,13,Fin places. Cloud will thicken through
OL,14,Fthe morning, bringing outbreaks of
OL,15,Fshowery rain by day. Less cold than of
OL,16,Flate, with a gentle breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
